    RMS|err| ~ x^0.488   (predict 0.50 == sqrt(x) hard zone)
    err/sqrt(p(n)): median/mean/max = 0.145/0.178/0.721  (guess_oracle S491: 0.13/-/0.53)
    trend of err/sqrt(x) vs x: slope -0.007  (~0 == ratio BOUNDED -> window is Theta(sqrt x), F2 not triggered)

